# CLAUDE.md — alkanes-rs

> Drop this file at the root of `alkanes-rs` to pull in the subfrost-ops domain pack.

**Layer**: foundational. This repo publishes the indexer + ts-sdk + types other repos consume. Changes here may ripple to **subfrost-app** (via ts-sdk) and **subfrost-mobile** (via shared Rust types) — not mechanically, but conceptually. For non-trivial changes, run the `stack-preflight` agent to get a downstream-ripple context brief. See `docs/LAYER-MODEL.md` for the directional-impact rule.

This is the canonical Rust implementation of the Alkanes metaprotocol on Bitcoin. Workspace contains the indexer crates, the WASM contract runtime helpers, the `metashrew_core` bridge, and the `ts-sdk` for frontend consumption.

## Pre-work skills to load
- `alkanes-onboarding` — mental model + pre-work rules
- `opcode-dispatch` — `#[derive(MessageDispatch)]` conventions
- `protostone-cellpack-edicts` — the canonical `output: 1` pattern
- `metashrew-indexer-patterns` — `_start`, append-only storage, view fns
- `ts-sdk-alkanes-execute` — frontend-side call shape
- `wasm-build-pipeline` — Cargo profile + size budgets

## Reviewers to invoke
- `alkanes-protocol-reviewer` for contract opcode changes
- `metashrew-indexer-reviewer` for indexer changes
- `wasm-contract-auditor` before deploying a new contract
- `rust-reviewer` (built-in) for general Rust hygiene

## Rules pack
- `rules/alkanes/*` (security, patterns, testing, coding-style, hooks)
- `rules/rust/*` (built-in)
- `rules/common/*` (built-in)

## Tests
```bash
cargo test                 # all crates
cargo test -p alkanes-rs   # indexer only
```

